# sets1 — SADD: unique members
#
# Learn: a set holds unique strings with no order. SADD ignores members
# that are already there (and returns how many were new), SISMEMBER is an
# O(1) membership test, SCARD counts members.
#
# Task: the tag importer sees the same tag several times. Store the tags
# of article 1 in article:1:tags so each tag appears once, whatever the
# input. Then ask whether the article is tagged "redis".
#

RPUSH article:1:tags redis cache redis nosql cache
LRANGE article:1:tags 0 -1
